  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["SWII", "PRII"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Class III, mains- or battery-operated, self-indicating, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments of the SWII and PRII Series, comprising the SWII, PRII-B, PRII-P and PRII-U models and their variants. May be used for direct sales to the public. Plastic construction with operator keypad and level indicator; load receptor plastic (SWII) or stainless steel (SWII and PRII); dual, integral or pole-mounted LCD or LED display. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, zero indicator, net indicator, unit change (g, kg), stable weight indicator (SWII), semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing device, gravity compensation, price-computing (PRII), totalisation (PRII), PLU (PRII), piece counting (SWII), hold function (SWII), checkweighing (SWII). Software designated V1.xx; software download only possible via the ICP interface (connector CON1) and protected by switches on the main board; legally relevant parameters accessible only via the calibration switch. Access to the load cell, electronics, calibration and software download switches secured via a tamper-evident solution bearing a securing mark. Interfaces: RS232C, USB."
  },
